    <string name="receta_ejemplo_nombre">Baked Salmon with Vegetables</string>
    <string name="receta_ejemplo_tiempo">Time: 25 minutes</string>
    <string name="receta_ejemplo_dificultad">Difficulty: Easy</string>

    <string name="etiqueta_ingredientes">Required ingredients</string>
    <string name="texto_ingredientes">• 2 fresh salmon fillets\n• 1 medium zucchini, sliced\n• 1 red bell pepper, sliced\n• 2 tbsp extra virgin olive oil\n• Salt and black pepper</string>

    <string name="etiqueta_preparacion">Preparation steps</string>
    <string name="texto_preparacion">1. Preheat oven to 190°C (375°F).\n2. Place sliced vegetables on a baking tray with olive oil and salt.\n3. Put salmon fillets on top of vegetables.\n4. Bake for 15-18 minutes until tender.\n5. Serve immediately warm.</string>

